  "host": {
    "name": "Dr Eslam Afifi",
    "bio1": "Hello, I'm Dr Eslam Afifi - a CX and data leader with over 15 years of experience helping organizations across Australia, Europe, and the GCC. I've learned that great experiences don't come from one element alone: they're created through the right Algorithm of people, data, and technology.",
    "bio2": "I created The CX Algorithm to bring together diverse voices - innovators, leaders, and storytellers - who each add something unique to the formula. Because when we listen, share, and collaborate, we uncover the real intelligence behind extraordinary customer experiences.",
